.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A Scheme lexer\&.

This parser is checked with pastes from the LISP pastebin
at http://paste\&.lisp\&.org/ to cover as much syntax as possible\&.

It supports the full Scheme syntax as defined in R5RS\&.

.fi
.PP
 
